F4:['R dorsolateral frontal','F','Right dorsolateral prefrontal cortex: middle frontal gyrus and the front edge of premotor cortex (Brodmann 8/9/46).','Beta; frontal theta; frontal intermittent rhythmic delta in encephalopathy; frontal spikes','Frontalis muscle, spill-over of eye movements'],
F7:['L inferior frontal / anterior temporal','F','Left inferior frontal gyrus (Broca area, Brodmann 44/45). Because it is low on the head, it also picks up the anterior temporal pole. Also written F7 in both the 10-20 and 10-10 systems.','Anterior temporal spikes and slowing often peak here; beta','Sideways eye movements (opposite polarity at F7 and F8), temporalis muscle'],
F8:['R inferior frontal / anterior temporal','F','Right inferior frontal gyrus. Because it is low on the head, it also picks up the anterior temporal pole.','Anterior temporal spikes and slowing often peak here; beta','Sideways eye movements (opposite polarity at F7 and F8), temporalis muscle'],
