C3:['L central','C','Left primary sensorimotor cortex: precentral and postcentral gyri (Brodmann 1 to 4), including the hand area. It governs the right hand. The letter C marks the central (Rolandic) region, not a lobe.','Mu rhythm, beta, sleep spindles, central (Rolandic) sharp waves','Rarely muscle; pulses from a scalp artery can show here'],
C4:['R central','C','Right primary sensorimotor cortex: precentral and postcentral gyri (Brodmann 1 to 4), including the hand area. It governs the left hand.','Mu rhythm, beta, sleep spindles, central (Rolandic) sharp waves','Rarely muscle; pulses from a scalp artery can show here'],
