O2:['R occipital','O','Right occipital pole: primary and association visual cortex (Brodmann 17/18/19, around the calcarine fissure).','Posterior dominant (alpha) rhythm, lambda waves, POSTS, photic driving','Electrode pop, neck muscle at low occipital positions'],
