T4:['R mid-temporal','T','Right middle temporal gyrus on the side of the brain, sitting just above auditory cortex (Brodmann 21/22). Also called T8 in the 10-10 system.','Wickets, temporal alpha-range ("third rhythm"), temporal spikes and TIRDA','Jaw clenching (temporalis muscle); pulse from the temporal artery'],
