A1:['L ear (reference)','R','Left earlobe or mastoid. It is not over cortex, so it is used as a reference. It is not silent: it picks up inferior and anterior temporal activity and the heart.','Reference only. A temporal spike at T3 leaks into A1','ECG, temporalis muscle'],
